---
source: crates/surfaces/cli/src/main.rs
expression: command.clone().render_long_help().to_string()
---
Output the Graph Protocol schema

Usage: specforge schema [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --path <PATH>
          A path inside the project (the nearest directory at or above it holding specforge.json; none: the directory itself, with the default configuration)
          
          [default: .]

      --kind <KIND>
          That entity kind and the edge types that can start or end at it

      --no-edges
          Leave the edge types out

      --validation-rules
          Add the validation rules the loaded extensions declare

      --publish
          Publish as standalone JSON Schema (draft 2020-12)

      --config
          Write the JSON Schema of this project's specforge.json, with every loaded extension's settings typed

      --format <FORMAT>
          Export format the published schema describes

          Possible values:
          - graph:   every entity with its fields, file and line (Graph Protocol)
          - context: every entity's fields, annotations, methods and verify, its headline on top, without file and line, for an agent
          - brief:   id, kind and title
          
          [default: graph]

  -h, --help
          Print help (see a summary with '-h')
